    "title": "Crazy Challenge: Mini Games 3D",
    "description": "To give your brain a workout while having fun, try these fun games and activities that may improve your IQ. It's so hard to win these tricky and satisfying challenges.\r\n\r\nGet ready for 'Crazy Challenge 3D: Mini Games': fun for all ages, and a brain workout too. This tricky game collection is like a virtual toy box with more than 20 mini game challenges. This game is for those who love to take challenges, test their brain to boost IQ level in satisfying games. \r\n\r\nOur multiple mini games like balloon smash games, archery games, tricky phone charging challenge, car driving challenge To pass every level you face more exciting challenges like shooting zombies in gun games.\r\n\r\nStep into the world of tricky games and try to throw phones on target to pass level in this mini game collection. Ever wanted to try your hand on relaxing games with satisfying ASMR sounds then explore our tricky game challenges and train your brain to play this fun game.\r\n\r\nAnnoying Challenge: Mini Games Features:\r\n\r\n1.Click to hit on dart and smash apple with archery skills.\ud83c\udfaf\ud83c\udff9\r\n2.Jump into challenging levels and explore the full of action levels.\ud83c\udfaf\ud83c\udfc5\r\n3.Download to have fun in this anti-stress mini game.\ud83d\udcf2\ud83d\udc4c\r\n4.Perfect time pass gameplay to release your stress.\u23f0\ud83c\udf89\r\n5.To pass a level you face new challenge with tricky gameplay.\ud83e\udd39\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa2\r\n6.ASMR sounds effects increase the overall engaging gameplay.\ud83c\udfb6\ud83d\ude02\r\n\r\nDownload Annoying Challenge: Mini Games and start your adventure today!",
